0..79 Comment "/// The default build stage: a package\'s `package.gandr.toml` body, rendered by"
80..137 Comment "/// a gandr function from its model\'s fields and modules."
138..141 Comment "///"
142..219 Comment "/// A package\'s own build stage is to write its manifest, the checker\'s fixed"
220..299 Comment "/// rule its default. Before the checker can run a stage, this source shows the"
300..364 Comment "/// default spelled in gandr: each run is the body of a manifest"
365..386 Comment "/// the tree commits."
387..390 Comment "///"
391..465 Comment "/// `body` reads the name, the version and the module list, and writes the"
466..545 Comment "/// `[package]` table as the checker does. The checker keeps the header and its"
546..626 Comment "/// BLAKE3 digest, which only it computes. A name holding a quote is not escaped"
627..675 Comment "/// here: that needs the characters of a string."
676..679 Comment "///"
680..696 Comment "/// - see: #2764"
697..713 Comment "/// - see: #2997"
714..730 Comment "/// - see: #2998"
731..790 Comment "/// - see: `corpus/model/projects/hello/package.gandr.toml`"
